{"seq":26,"slug":"human-ai-collaboration","title":"人机协作开发模式","stage":"DONE","category":"ai-native-engineering","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/human-ai-collaboration","rating":{"composite":3.55,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":2.75,"positioning":3,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"人机协作开发模式-简介\">人机协作开发模式 简介</h1><p>AI 正在从根本上改变软件开发的方式。从代码补全到自动生成测试、从代码审查到架构建议，AI 已经成为许多开发者日常工作中不可或缺的「搭档」。但与 AI 协作不是「让 AI 写代码」那么简单——它需要新的技能、新的工作流、新的质量控制方式。</p>\n<p>本知识库面向三类读者：想提高生产力的个人开发者、想在团队中推广 AI 工具的技术负责人、以及想系统理解人机协作开发模式的工程师。我们用工程师的精确性来组织内容——每个工具都有适用场景、每种工作流都有最佳实践、每个 AI 输出都有质量控制方法。</p>\n<p>四条主线贯穿全库。</p>\n<p>第一条主线是<strong>AI 结对编程</strong>。我们讨论主流的 AI 编程助手（GitHub Copilot、Cursor、Claude Code 等）、如何写出好的代码提示（Prompt Engineering for Code）、以及 AI 辅助代码审查。AI 结对编程的核心不是「让 AI 替你写代码」，而是「让 AI 成为你的编程搭档」——你负责架构和方向，AI 负责实现和细节。</p>\n<p>第二条主线是<strong>AI 开发工作流</strong>。AI 不只是写代码——它可以嵌入到开发的整个流程中：CI/CD 中的 AI 步骤、自动生成测试、自动生成和维护文档。我们讨论如何将 AI 整合到现有的开发工作流中，以及如何衡量 AI 带来的生产力提升。</p>\n<p>第三条主线是<strong>Agent 监督与管理</strong>。随着 AI Agent 变得越来越强大（能够自主执行多步骤任务），人类的角色从「操作者」变成了「监督者」。我们讨论 AI Agent 的能力和局限、如何确保 Agent 的安全（不做有害的事）、以及「人在回路中」（Human-in-the-Loop）的设计模式。</p>\n<p>第四条主线是<strong>团队 AI 转型</strong>。个人使用 AI 工具和整个团队采用 AI 是两回事。我们讨论团队采用 AI 的常见障碍和成功因素、开发者需要培养的新技能（提示工程、AI 输出评估、与 Agent 协作）、以及人机协作对未来工作的影响。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>hub</th>\n<th>聚焦</th>\n<th>读者何时需要它</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>人机协作开发模式</strong>（本 hub）</td>\n<td>人与 AI 如何协作开发软件</td>\n<td>使用 AI 工具的开发者和团队</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AI 应用架构</td>\n<td>如何构建 AI 原生应用</td>\n<td>设计 AI 系统的架构师</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LLM 应用开发</td>\n<td>使用 LLM API 开发应用</td>\n<td>调用 LLM API 的开发者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开发者生产力</td>\n<td>个人和团队生产力工具和实践</td>\n<td>关注效率的工程师</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>软件工程实践</td>\n<td>传统软件工程最佳实践</td>\n<td>基础工程方法</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>个人开发者路径</strong>：AI 结对编程 → 提示工程 → AI 开发工作流。重点是提高个人生产力。</li>\n<li><strong>技术负责人路径</strong>：按章节顺序通读，重点关注团队转型和 Agent 管理。</li>\n<li><strong>快速上手路径</strong>：直接读「AI 编程助手」和「提示工程」，开始在日常工作中使用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>基本的软件开发经验（能写代码、理解 Git、了解 CI/CD）</li>\n<li>对 AI/LLM 的基本了解（不需要机器学习背景）</li>\n<li>对新工具和新工作方式的开放心态</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ai-pair-programming","title":"AI 结对编程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/human-ai-collaboration/ai-pair-programming","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ai-coding-assistants","title":"AI 编程助手","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/human-ai-collaboration/ai-pair-programming/ai-coding-assistants"},{"seq":2,"slug":"prompt-engineering-code","title":"代码提示工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/human-ai-collaboration/ai-pair-programming/prompt-engineering-code"},{"seq":3,"slug":"code-review-ai","title":"AI 辅助代码审查","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/human-ai-collaboration/ai-pair-programming/code-review-ai"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"ai-development-workflows","title":"AI 开发工作流","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/human-ai-collaboration/ai-development-workflows","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ai-in-cicd","title":"AI 在 CI/CD 中","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/human-ai-collaboration/ai-development-workflows/ai-in-cicd"},{"seq":2,"slug":"test-generation-ai","title":"AI 生成测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/human-ai-collaboration/ai-development-workflows/test-generation-ai"},{"seq":3,"slug":"documentation-ai","title":"AI 辅助文档生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/human-ai-collaboration/ai-development-workflows/documentation-ai"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"agent-supervision","title":"Agent 监督与管理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/human-ai-collaboration/agent-supervision","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ai-agents-overview","title":"AI Agent 概览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/human-ai-collaboration/agent-supervision/ai-agents-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"agent-safety","title":"Agent 安全与护栏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/human-ai-collaboration/agent-supervision/agent-safety"},{"seq":3,"slug":"human-in-the-loop","title":"人在回路中","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/human-ai-collaboration/agent-supervision/human-in-the-loop"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"team-ai-transformation","title":"团队 AI 转型","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/human-ai-collaboration/team-ai-transformation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"team-ai-adoption","title":"团队 AI 采用策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/human-ai-collaboration/team-ai-transformation/team-ai-adoption"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ai-skills-developers","title":"开发者的 AI 技能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/human-ai-collaboration/team-ai-transformation/ai-skills-developers"},{"seq":3,"slug":"future-work","title":"人机协作的未来","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/human-ai-collaboration/team-ai-transformation/future-work"}]}]}